ESP8089 TXR8-BAW1 modifications, 21 October 2026

This firmware changes the consolidated TXR8 baseline by enforcing the minimum
negotiated TX BA window per peer before enabling a session, retaining the
existing eight-frame ceiling. Three old pipeline-stop diagnostic hooks are
removed to provide overlay space. No new command ABI or state allocation.

The original Apache-2.0 license and attribution are retained verbatim in
LICENSE-firmware.txt and NOTICE-firmware.txt. BASELINE-CONSOLIDATION-NOTICE.txt
is a historical baseline record; its no-byte-change statement does not describe
this modified TXR8-BAW1 image. The new files identify their Apache-2.0 license.
The test/production Linux driver is separately GPL-2.0-only.

Firmware sources here are extension sources, not a recovered vendor SDK or
chip ROM source. See README.rst, provenance.json and overlay-manifest.json
for the exact modified image, input identity and experimental validation.
